#: scenario8:scenario8_538603F2_DF0F_4375_93D4_E9F2786EFA69
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: db8d0cb5e80195818137616b05313d2ebdf6931e15809002d1adfa404b09fe86
#. default-sha256: cbf28148e1daae0b0b93d403817ebc9daa5c3a5017179a3ea44c1afe1beb0870
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_538603F2_DF0F_4375_93D4_E9F2786EFA69"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫When he takes the necklace, Jacopo looks as though he’s on the "
"verge of tears."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫목걸이를 받은 야코포의 얼굴은 ⟪k:7⟫울음을 터트릴 것처럼도 ⟪k:8⟫"
"보였다.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫그러고도 눈물을 단 한 방울도 흘리지 않은 이유는――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_B0BC1945_691B_4EF0_AC20_A025AC10EF48
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bfb7b424dc38aa4b55822058b95048dd0683f52a02464519df2d0fba608e0bf8
#. default-sha256: ad5d90fc4a32d5ed58812d1743e2c58322787fb810a4d69e961adce8bdc4d00f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B0BC1945_691B_4EF0_AC20_A025AC10EF48"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Whether from the pressure of not wanting to lose face, or simply because he’s no longer able "
"to, he doesn’t actually shed any, though."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫야코포 안에서 ⟪k:1⟫아직 ⟪k:2⟫남의 눈이 중압이기 때문일까――, ⟪k:3⟫아니면 ⟪k:4⟫이미 모든 눈물"
"이 말라붙었기 때문일까……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_9DACE528_5CF3_410D_A06C_DFDBE77E8496
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 214b913d2e69a480b3f35b11baf53b32d50370f694c9e501c7388a8d3ad9e3f2
#. default-sha256: af5414ceb4f4fa8d67e293a882963fecf9a33123fccd553218af8e2078174f22
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9DACE528_5CF3_410D_A06C_DFDBE77E8496"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The other two just stand and watch him quietly."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫다른 둘은 ⟪k:1⟫그 모습을 잠자코 지켜보았다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫……야코포의 과거를 본 건 나 뿐이지만――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_9E494A6D_9D0A_4A0A_B295_7EAC70594827
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 460195e5d701e587d4bf9d3b7bb8fff9a5d597d12f8e080db9ea586ae7072166
#. default-sha256: 224773efc5560b52a7830202bb871df92ed735846da10f0486f9898f401e32ec
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9E494A6D_9D0A_4A0A_B295_7EAC70594827"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Neither of them saw the vision of his past, but they don’t pry either."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫둘이 그 과거를 캐물으려 하진 ⟪k:1⟫않았다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_A65628ED_B3F4_4482_8AA8_AB8B6F5FBA83
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b3ce736ced02892387b9fdd613f35d6aae7f7ff6ce373f43c5e123aaa6741133
#. default-sha256: d30475645679e20af99050861d85a93e908ad128123b1d65422736219cd180e6
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A65628ED_B3F4_4482_8AA8_AB8B6F5FBA83"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Our exchange was probably sufficient to give them an idea of what happened, even if they "
"don’t know the details."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫야코포의 과거에 무슨 일이 있었는지 ⟪k:1⟫자세히는 모르더라도――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫나와 야코포의 대화를 "
"통해 ⟪k:4⟫느낀 것이 있으리라."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4331D23C_A965_432D_BF48_DCF3CB7E5BB4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e1a89fc296ecfe05efd5a8d322a3452f76d636a05f569c6201785071cf5778ff
#. default-sha256: eec2c49a443dac78168eccb0a9b10292d53c5d869c14be5e12a916941c9be85b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4331D23C_A965_432D_BF48_DCF3CB7E5BB4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Clutching the necklace in one hand, Jacopo takes up the head of the procession to the "
"observation tower."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫야코포는 목걸이를 꽉 쥐곤, ⟪k:1⟫앞장서서 ⟪k:2⟫감시탑으로 가기 시작했다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E1DFF7A8_FE7F_4E19_8D0A_6122F084BA4D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8758fda9c69b2f27d096c0d5ad97ca5646d4f7cdbf9b08366651932358de6ad7
#. default-sha256: 5b151e8d2e1bb65ebebd30487e2a64799b50a9f12d4873ab5d1f3811571b08f3
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E1DFF7A8_FE7F_4E19_8D0A_6122F084BA4D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And while it lasts but for a brief moment,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나는 그 등에――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_C5189E0F_0867_4E32_95DB_CBC3BCFDF31D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fe2b77838e25caf36756347158307b652644ba9f1fb9269814838a8246840324
#. default-sha256: b886e79df21f7b102e630b5552651ac7790a94c170e324db3e2db7b0e6685291
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_C5189E0F_0867_4E32_95DB_CBC3BCFDF31D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I see an image of the young man he used to be in his slightly slouched shoulders."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아주 짧은 순간이나마, ⟪k:1⟫과거의 청년을 ⟪k:2⟫겹쳐 보았다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_EFE9D80D_62E2_4FAD_8C40_48885718C854
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bb684d4f031654c297b86a07673ee2ad65710399bf19df1467fdce8cd890efb2
#. default-sha256: ae06edbb2dc88e3437f6b0943bcb035a5a6b2ed94b6763db1ff7693c7f4208cb
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EFE9D80D_62E2_4FAD_8C40_48885718C854"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫They "
"each insert and turn their individual keys,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫열쇠 세 "
"개가 끼워지자――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_78C4A1AD_06F0_404A_A911_289C2D1A8545
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b6357a7a45042cf605fd431bb72a824f09a2cf7204f17e9432409b6a8184f95a
#. default-sha256: 86f91c616964096c53edb7c408ebe235189f5b11b9fee18356793917de1c48ca
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_78C4A1AD_06F0_404A_A911_289C2D1A8545"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫the lock disengaging and the door giving a deep groan as it swings open."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫문이 ⟪k:1⟫묵직한 소리를 내며 ⟪k:2⟫열렸다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_23F4E655_115E_47D8_81D4_32424412E816
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fe87e1b704623c83911d6c1e7603d7c9fa41434caeccd87b236a6479be52aaab
#. default-sha256: 630e31e1d9e31c9ae92564ca45bba5c7cbf22ed6cd7bc46c68a28eb16ea87f9e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_23F4E655_115E_47D8_81D4_32424412E816"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Beyond it, a spiral staircase extends high into the sky."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫그 안에 ⟪k:3⟫나선 계단이 보였다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_039FE425_1400_4CF4_91E9_3587DDD3BA30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e6135549a3177baec26f7978dcced92d296c249f7d849781769d5ca8e0d32591
#. default-sha256: 6a5bbd789d87fe3a564190233bd1648b1a1fc10ca2bb1db657403bd33ce125bb
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_039FE425_1400_4CF4_91E9_3587DDD3BA30"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Every time I’ve climbed these stairs, it’s always been a solemn affair—⟪k:1⟫and now is no "
"different."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫어느 시대든 ⟪k:1⟫이 계단을 오를 때는…… 갑갑한 감정이 일었다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫이 순간도 ⟪k:4⟫예외가 "
"아니었다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_2940BC09_DF88_414F_83CD_7E63A3C23521
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fd5424f0f14d452fca4ce2e857f517e06b36f0288f946b63658ddfbb56960e02
#. default-sha256: 53fd32bfead62c50cd07df32011d3220cb421a66ee36b5049535c95ae6bb6201
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2940BC09_DF88_414F_83CD_7E63A3C23521"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I’ve succeeded, though. I’ve got them all here,⟪k:1⟫ready to set her free before she’s "
"supposed to die."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그래도―― ⟪k:1⟫모르가나가 죽기 전에 ⟪k:2⟫여기까지 왔다.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫모르가나가 죽는 건 내일 정오"
"――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_1A5A083C_156A_46D0_A0BC_EED6903904BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 293ac7fad76c008c98ffa44e111945df70512b3503251d3392fef51f0e5f6ca1
#. default-sha256: 0d628b53ddb787fd029b1f644a01cf14f1e4fc35c658f672ea479008f2c1061a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_1A5A083C_156A_46D0_A0BC_EED6903904BE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I have changed the past."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나는―― ⟪k:1⟫바꾸는 데 성공한 것이다……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_F9A6BD9D_1C88_4277_B45E_8C335670875A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3fd421a952ca941372fd3f2267e54d70bc9203caad96f37519dfd7bb013618ca
#. default-sha256: 8668493dc434463ff06044e6fd703f57f82e3eaa960d11b1d32167a8cb526710
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F9A6BD9D_1C88_4277_B45E_8C335670875A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Giselle..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……지젤……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_33743BC5_AF6A_473E_8843_257470755545
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e86eac3c6eb4c62c12f12f14537921b4662dfc4296a0a1f74781b17495561187
#. default-sha256: 72bf97740a812d72832bacc1f52d922962f76cd276ba43360d71499f27886561
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_33743BC5_AF6A_473E_8843_257470755545"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Can you hear me, Giselle?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I made it in time..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫지젤, ⟪k:2⟫들어 주십시오…….⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫저는 늦지 않았습니다……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4B81E828_6EC6_45D6_8382_0A7C6458FC9F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1023cc7538cf190cef866f7497cf35740b6d8a508040f93dfa2120f10d338327
#. default-sha256: acedbc55dd2ac6ab214d36e4105552045acbf179267c94b373121f39b456940c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4B81E828_6EC6_45D6_8382_0A7C6458FC9F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Now Morgana doesn’t have to die tomorrow..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……이제 모르가나가 죽을 일은 없습니다……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_3A15591A_25A6_44B6_ADFF_A459432D8302
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 57fa23cc6680ef589c6a177734dc188271f66227f05a0b0b828bcb07aa283ba2
#. default-sha256: def9eedca77d7a13e0b3ab01f676eb4c7ff41f3ec331a76ae522f09211079e77
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3A15591A_25A6_44B6_ADFF_A459432D8302"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I did it..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……제가 해냈습니다……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_B4D4045F_123A_4C55_8D4D_6D1CB19B18B5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e12d91a6fbf7d83d98140bffdd95843d009fbed6c718c8a967264a3adb8361ba
