msgid "⟪k:0⟫I’m... ⟪k:1⟫the man who spent the next three years with you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……나는…… ⟪k:1⟫너랑…… 3년을 함께 보낸 남자야."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E27E7DA8_AFAC_461E_A7D4_68D60CE345B8
