msgstr "⟪k:0⟫가난하고 ⟪k:1⟫먹을 것도 변변찮아서 ⟪k:2⟫풍족한 생활이라 하긴 힘들었지만――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_DC8BAFE9_EAC4_4EF1_87EE_A6079A502618
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
