msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그때는 ⟪k:1⟫진심으로 ⟪k:2⟫즐거웠어……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4C06A37C_30B7_484F_B411_2E261D2172F7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
