msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Just about every day, I’d come to rub ointment on your face...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I’d tell you to look "
"at me, and you’d reluctantly turn my way..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫거의 매일 꼬박꼬박…… ⟪k:1⟫너한테 약을 발랐지…….⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫얼굴을 대라 하면, ⟪k:4⟫마지못해 따르"
"는 네가――"

