"⟪k:0⟫I can only imagine how obnoxious you thought the two of us were when we were in the same "
"room together..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫마리아랑 내가 옥신각신하는 꼴은…… ⟪k:1⟫네가 보기엔 ⟪k:2⟫정신 사나웠겠지만――"

