"⟪k:0⟫You sitting off alone while me and Maria go at it, not making a peep, me always trying to "
"sneak glances at you..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나는 그러고 싸울 때도…… ⟪k:1⟫조용히 있는 너를…… ⟪k:2⟫매번…… ⟪k:3⟫보고 있었어……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_FDD7A009_18AA_40A3_8C1F_EB42AB4D56A1
